    "Telephony": "电话",
    "Credentials go on the APIs page: a \"Telnyx\" entry with its API key, or a \"Twilio\" entry with the account SID as client key and the auth token as API key. Leave blank to turn telephony off.": "凭据填写在 API 页面：一个带有 API 密钥的 \"Telnyx\" 条目，或一个以账户 SID 作为客户端密钥、以认证令牌作为 API 密钥的 \"Twilio\" 条目。留空则关闭电话功能。",
    "From number": "主叫号码",
    "Your number at the provider, in E.164 form: the setup button verifies it as caller ID, and inbound calls to it are answered by the agent below.": "你在提供商处的号码，采用 E.164 格式：设置按钮会将其验证为来电显示，拨入该号码的电话将由下方的智能体接听。",
