    "Answer incoming calls automatically after this many seconds, unless answered or rejected first.": "在此秒数后自动接听来电，除非已先被接听或拒绝。",
    "OpenAI project ID": "OpenAI 项目 ID",
    "Calls are bridged to sip:<project id>@sip.api.openai.com.": "通话会桥接到 sip:<project id>@sip.api.openai.com。",
    "Allowed countries": "允许的国家",
    "Countries calls may be placed to, as comma-separated ISO codes such as GB, US. Applied to the selected provider when changed, and by its setup button.": "允许拨打的国家，以逗号分隔的 ISO 代码表示，例如 GB, US。更改时以及点击设置按钮时会应用到所选提供商。",
    "Telnyx connection ID": "Telnyx 连接 ID",
    "The Telnyx voice application calls are placed through. \"Set up Telnyx\" creates it for you; its webhook URL is kept up to date automatically.": "用于拨打电话的 Telnyx 语音应用。“设置 Telnyx”会为你创建；其 webhook URL 会自动保持最新。",
    "Set up Telnyx": "设置 Telnyx",
    "Creates the voice application and outbound profile through the Telnyx API, then verifies the From number as caller ID by SMS code.": "通过 Telnyx API 创建语音应用和外呼配置，然后通过短信验证码将主叫号码验证为来电显示。",
    "Set up Twilio": "设置 Twilio",
    "Enables the allowed countries and points the From number at the webhook through the Twilio API, then verifies the From number as caller ID with a call from Twilio if the account does not own it.": "通过 Twilio API 启用允许的国家并将主叫号码指向 webhook；如果账户并不拥有该号码，则通过 Twilio 来电将其验证为来电显示。",
    "Public URL": "公共 URL",
    "Filled in automatically: a Cloudflare quick tunnel is opened to the listener whenever a provider is set, and OpenAI and the provider are pointed at it.": "自动填写：每当设置提供商时，都会打开一个通往监听器的 Cloudflare 快速隧道，并将 OpenAI 和提供商指向它。",
